{"id":"636665","name":"原味薯片","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636665/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"800克"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"稍宽"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好土豆。","img":"images/636665/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮，清洗干净。","img":"images/636665/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用刨皮刀，刨成薄片。","img":"images/636665/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"薄薄的哦。","img":"images/636665/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"清洗干净淀粉，捞出。","img":"images/636665/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧水。","img":"images/636665/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后，下入土豆片，焯水半分钟，一变色就捞出，过凉水。","img":"images/636665/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"沥干水分，稍微晾干。","img":"images/636665/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/636665/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油五成热时，下入土豆片片(分次炸，一次不要放太多)。","img":"images/636665/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"中小火，炸。","img":"images/636665/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"土豆片浮起。","img":"images/636665/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"变色即可捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/636665/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/636665/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"入口即化的感觉。","img":"images/636665/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"酥酥脆脆的。","img":"images/636665/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636665/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}